# Q224_TestOfSagittarius, start with the diamonds already paid: the character holds the secondClassChange39 memo, so the start event gives no
# Dimensional Diamonds (no item message, no memo write) and the accept page is the plain one, not the "a" page.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace).
character Sagittarius 39
class 35
memo secondClassChange39 true
hold 3298 8
hold 3299 8
script quest.Q224_TestOfSagittarius
item 17 3028 3293 3294 3295 3296 3297 3298 3299 3300 3301 3302 3303 3304 3305 3306 7562
page default/30702.htm
page default/30626.htm
page default/30653.htm
page trainer/30514.htm
page trainer/30717.htm
page script/quest/Q224_TestOfSagittarius/
npc bernard 30702 Folk 10 0 0
npc hamil 30626 Folk -10 0 0
npc aron 30653 Folk 0 10 0
npc vokian 30514 Trainer 0 -10 0
npc gauen 30717 Trainer 10 10 0
npc ant 20079 Monster 40 0 0
